      "levels": [
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Regularity matters more than intensity."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Walking every day is already an excellent foundation."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Fourth pillar: stress management"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Occasional stress is normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Chronic stress becomes a problem when it no longer leaves the body time to recover."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most effective measures include:"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "Deep breathing.",
        "Physical activity.",
        "Sufficient sleep.",
        "Leisure activities.",
        "Social contact.",
        "Time spent in nature."
      ],
      "levels": [
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Learning to slow down is sometimes the best treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Fifth pillar: digestive well-being"
