    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "To reduce stress.",
        "To improve mood.",
        "To promote mental recovery.",
        "To encourage physical activity."
      ],
      "levels": [
        0,
        0,
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Walking in a park or a forest is a simple habit with considerable benefits."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "Ninth pillar: giving meaning to one’s life"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Well-being also depends on a sense of usefulness and personal coherence."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Having:"
    },
    {
